          "text": "（22）（Ⅰ）\\(\\operatorname{Cov}(X,Z)=\\lambda\\)。（Ⅱ）\\(P\\{Z=i\\}=\\begin{cases}\\frac12\\frac{\\lambda^i e^{-\\lambda}}{i!},&i>0,\\\\e^{-\\lambda},&i=0,\\\\\\frac12\\frac{\\lambda^{-i}e^{-\\lambda}}{(-i)!},&i<0.\\end{cases}\\)"
